{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Kaedei.Dandanplay","latestVersion":"18.2.6","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"Kaedei","copyright":"Copyright © Kaedei 2012-2026","description":"Versatile player combining local video with Danmu","license":"Freeware","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Kaedei","copyright":"Copyright © Kaedei 2012-2026","description":"Versatile player combining local video with Danmu","license":"Freeware","locale":"en-US","name":"弹弹play","packageUrl":"https://www.dandanplay.com/","privacyUrl":"https://www.dandanplay.com/privacy.html","publisher":"Kaedei","publisherSupportUrl":"https://www.dandanplay.com/contact.html","publisherUrl":"https://www.dandanplay.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.dandanplay.com/blog.html","tags":["animation","anime","danmaku","danmu","media","multimedia","player","video"]},"zh-CN":{"author":"Kaedei","copyright":"Copyright © Kaedei 2012-2026","description":"全功能“本地视频+弹幕”播放器","license":"免费软件","locale":"zh-CN","name":"弹弹play","packageUrl":"https://www.dandanplay.com/","privacyUrl":"https://www.dandanplay.com/privacy.html","publisher":"Kaedei","publisherSupportUrl":"https://www.dandanplay.com/contact.html","publisherUrl":"https://www.dandanplay.com/","releaseNotes":"更新内容：\n- 新增了原生基于 D3D11 GPU 加速的 Anime4K 超分功能（VLC、EVR、FFmpeg 内核）；\n- 新增了对 PGS（.sup） 图片字幕格式的渲染支持；\n- 新增了对 VobSub（.sub+.idx）图片字幕格式的渲染支持；\n- 支持在 Windows 系统媒体控制面板（任务栏“快速设置”面板顶部的媒体播放控制条）显示播放状态并控制播放；\n- 远程媒体库支持通过域名连接 SMB 服务器；\n- 优化了右键菜单的样式；\n- mpv 内核现在不需要会员即可使用；\n- 修复了 mpv 内核在启用 OpenGL 渲染时可能在加载过程中死锁的问题；\n- 修复了一个 EVR 内核字幕滤镜（DirectVobSub）与弹弹 play 字幕渲染器冲突的问题；\n- 修复了自动下载规则同步状态异常的问题；\n- 更新了内置的 Kazumi/Animeko 规则；\n- 补充了缺失的国际化文本；\n功能说明：\n- 此版本引入了基于原版 GLSL Anime4K 的完整等效移植版本，使用 C# + D3D11 在 GPU 上进行计算和渲染，将超分功能引入 VLC/EVR/FFmpeg 等内核；\n- 使用 FFmpeg 内核并开启 Anime4K 时可能会出现稍微卡顿的情况，请将 FFmpeg 内核的硬件加速设置修改为 DXVA2。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.dandanplay.com/blog.html","tags":["动漫","动画","多媒体","媒体","弹幕","影音","播放器","视频"]}},"name":"弹弹play","packageUrl":"https